+# Feature Specification: Input validation
+
+**Created**: 2026-11-17 | **Status**: Implemented
+**Input**: "Reject invalid input with a clear error when a task is added, renamed or tagged."
+
+## Requirements
+- **FR-001**: A title that is empty or only spaces is rejected (add, rename).
+- **FR-002**: A title longer than 120 characters, once trimmed, is rejected (add, rename).
+- **FR-003**: A priority other than `low`, `normal`, `high` is rejected (add).
+- **FR-004**: A tag that is empty or contains a space is rejected (add with tags, tag).
+- **FR-005**: Rejections return a `Result` with code `invalid-input` and a message saying what is wrong; the list is unchanged.
+
+## Assumptions
+- "Space" means any whitespace character. Validation runs before lookup, so bad input is reported even for an unknown task.
